    "description": "<ul><li><p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">You can always identify a proper gift for a particular person that does not risk giving offense or slighting them publicly.</span></p><p></p></li><li><p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">After performing a check to acquire or give a gift (such as a Design [Water] check to select an item that complements someone’s wardrobe or a Commerce [Water] check to find and select a gift at a market), you remove 3 strife.</span></p></li></ul>",
