   "system": {
    "source_reference": {
     "source": "emerald_empire",
     "page": 247
    },
    "description": "<ul><li><p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">You are intensely afraid of being enclosed in a small space or a space without an easy exit. You avoid entering such places if at all possible, and you feel anxious and distracted while in such a place.</span></p><p></p></li><li><p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">After making a check that requires to you enter an enclosed space (such as a Fitness [Water] check to crawl through a narrow passage or a Survival [Water] check to investigate a cave), you receive 3 strife. If this is the first time this has occurred this scene, gain 1 Void point.</span></p></li></ul>",
    "parent_id": null,
